    "@note": "★`feasible` is NOT a criterion: a null-field design that correctly reports「blocked at channel N under these limits」is a successful run with an unwelcome answer, and scoring it here would make `fail` mean two different things. What a criterion would score is the SOLVE (did the bounded least-squares reach its own tolerance), and that number is not reported yet.",
